OL,3,ARussia and Ukraine exchange strikes as
OL,4,Atwo killed at Moldova border
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been killed after
OL,7,FRussian drones struck a border crossing
OL,8,Fbetween Ukraine and Moldova, Ukrainian
OL,9,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said.
OL,11,FThe Starokozache crossing, around 500km
OL,12,F(310 miles) south of Kyiv, was closed
OL,13,Fafter the overnight attack. Images from
OL,14,Fthe scene showed several cars left
OL,15,Fcompletely scorched, with wreckage and
OL,16,Fdebris strewn across the border post.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, four people, including a
OL,19,Fchild, were killed in the southern
OL,20,FRussian city of Novorossiysk in a
OL,21,FUkrainian drone attack, the regional
OL,22,Fgovernor said.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
